<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cassandra — MLB Lockout Sentiment Report</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:        #0a0c10;
    --bg2:       #0f1117;
    --bg3:       #161920;
    --border:    #1e2330;
    --accent:    #7c6af7;
    --accent2:   #4fc3f7;
    --negative:  #f87171;
    --neutral:   #94a3b8;
    --positive:  #4ade80;
    --text:      #e2e8f0;
    --muted:     #64748b;
    --glow:      rgba(124,106,247,0.15);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 48px 24px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  .header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
  }

  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .header-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .meta-item {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--neutral);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── VADER BLOCK ── */
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
  }

  .section:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .section:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .section:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  .section:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .section:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .section-label::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  h3 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent2);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
  }

  /* ── STAT CARDS ── */
  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .stat-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .stat-card.negative::before { background: var(--negative); }
  .stat-card.neutral::before  { background: var(--neutral); }
  .stat-card.positive::before { background: var(--positive); }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .stat-value.negative { color: var(--negative); }
  .stat-value.neutral  { color: var(--neutral); }
  .stat-value.positive { color: var(--positive); }

  /* ── TOPIC BARS ── */
  .topic-table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .topic-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
  }

  .topic-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .topic-score {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--negative);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .topic-score.highlight {
    color: var(--negative);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .topic-bar-wrap {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .topic-bar {
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--negative);
    border-radius: 2px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* ── DIVIDER ── */
  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  /* ── PROSE ── */
  .prose p {
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ── ANALYSIS CARDS ── */
  .analysis-card {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .analysis-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .analysis-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* ── RISK LIST ── */
  .risk-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .risk-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--negative);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .risk-num {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--border);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .risk-title {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--negative);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  /* ── STAKEHOLDER ── */
  .stakeholder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stakeholder-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .stakeholder-card {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }

  .stakeholder-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent2);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .stakeholder-card p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .footer {
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease 0.6s both;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .footer-brand span { color: var(--accent); }

  .footer-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-eyebrow">Cassandra Intelligence Pipeline</div>
    <h1>⚾ MLB Lockout<br><span>Sentiment Report</span></h1>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Generated</strong> &nbsp;2026-06-07 10:39</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Model</strong> &nbsp;qwen2.5:7b via Ollama</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Articles Analyzed</strong> &nbsp;87</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Inference</strong> &nbsp;Local — no external API</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- VADER PRE-ANALYSIS -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">VADER Pre-Analysis</div>
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat-card negative">
        <div class="stat-label">Overall Label</div>
        <div class="stat-value negative">Negative</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card negative">
        <div class="stat-label">Avg Compound Score</div>
        <div class="stat-value negative">−0.1403</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card positive">
        <div class="stat-label">Positive Articles</div>
        <div class="stat-value positive">11</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card neutral">
        <div class="stat-label">Neutral Articles</div>
        <div class="stat-value neutral">39</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card negative">
        <div class="stat-label">Negative Articles</div>
        <div class="stat-value negative">37</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Sentiment by Topic</h3>
    <div class="topic-table">
      <div class="topic-row">
        <div class="topic-name">MLB lockout CBA negotiations</div>
        <div class="topic-score">−0.0978</div>
        <div class="topic-bar-wrap"><div class="topic-bar" style="width:23%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-row">
        <div class="topic-name">MLB revenue sharing salary cap</div>
        <div class="topic-score">−0.0886</div>
        <div class="topic-bar-wrap"><div class="topic-bar" style="width:21%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-row">
        <div class="topic-name">MLBPA players union</div>
        <div class="topic-score">−0.1057</div>
        <div class="topic-bar-wrap"><div class="topic-bar" style="width:25%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-row" style="border-color: var(--negative);">
        <div class="topic-name">Rob Manfred — MLB commissioner</div>
        <div class="topic-score highlight">−0.4275</div>
        <div class="topic-bar-wrap"><div class="topic-bar" style="width:100%; opacity:0.9;"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- LLM ANALYSIS -->
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-label">LLM Analysis</div>
    <h2>Intelligence Report — MLB Lockout CBA Negotiations</h2>

    <!-- OVERALL SENTIMENT -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>1. Overall Sentiment</h3>
      <p>The overall sentiment is negative, with an average compound score of −0.1403. The majority of articles carry a negative or neutral tone, with only a small number showing positive inclinations. This aligns with the VADER pre-analysis — 85% of articles are either neutral or negative.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- NARRATIVE -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>2. Narrative Summary</h3>
      <p>The dominant themes revolve around concerns over a potential labor dispute and the complex nature of CBA discussions between the MLBPA and league management — centered on salary caps and revenue sharing. The tone shifts frequently from cautious optimism to pessimism, with several articles warning about the consequences of failing to reach an agreement.</p>
      <p>The prevailing narrative is one of uncertainty and risk. Rob Manfred has publicly expressed concerns over a potential lockout. Players unions are portrayed as resistant to proposals that could negatively impact members, while owners are depicted as pushing for reforms to protect league-wide financial health.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- LABOR LANDSCAPE -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>3. Labor &amp; Negotiation Landscape</h3>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--accent2)">Salary Cap</strong> — A central issue. Proposals from both sides show significant divergence. Owners see it as essential for competitive balance; players view it as detrimental to their earnings.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--accent2)">Revenue Sharing</strong> — Discussions continue but exact details remain elusive.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--accent2)">Key Sticking Points</strong> — Salary floor, arbitration reform, and the overall CBA structure remain unresolved.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- STAKEHOLDERS -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>4. Stakeholder Outlook</h3>
      <div class="stakeholder-grid">
        <div class="stakeholder-card">
          <h4>Players / MLBPA</h4>
          <p>Likely to maintain a hardline stance on salary cap and revenue sharing. The union has shown willingness to use leverage — including the threat of a work stoppage — to secure favorable terms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stakeholder-card">
          <h4>Owners / MLB Management</h4>
          <p>Strong push for changes to protect league-wide financial stability. Willing to engage in negotiations but less flexible on core proposals given historical player resistance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:16px; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted);">Near-term risk: a prolonged dispute could impact the upcoming season. Resolution in the short term is unlikely given the depth of current disagreements.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- RISKS -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>5. Key Risks to Watch</h3>
      <ul class="risk-list">
        <li>
          <span class="risk-num">01</span>
          <div><span class="risk-title">Work Stoppage</span>Continued deadlock could disrupt the upcoming season through cancellations or a shortened schedule.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="risk-num">02</span>
          <div><span class="risk-title">Financial Impact on Teams</span>A prolonged dispute could strain team finances and affect player salaries and contracts.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="risk-num">03</span>
          <div><span class="risk-title">Player Retention</span>Uncertainty may drive free agency decisions before a deal is reached.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="risk-num">04</span>
          <div><span class="risk-title">Fan Engagement</span>A lengthy labor dispute risks disenchanting fans, affecting attendance and broadcast revenue.</div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="risk-num">05</span>
          <div><span class="risk-title">Legal Challenges</span>Both sides could face legal action related to proposed changes, further delaying resolution.</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- CONCLUSION -->
    <div class="analysis-card">
      <h3>Conclusion</h3>
      <p>The current landscape of MLB CBA negotiations is fraught with tension and uncertainty. While there are signs of mutual interest in resolving disputes, significant disagreements remain. Both players and owners will need to navigate these carefully to avoid a lockout with far-reaching implications for the sport.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:12px;">40 articles analyzed for LLM reasoning layer. 87 total articles scored via VADER.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-brand"><span>Cassandra</span> — Stage One Cloud</div>
    <div class="footer-note">Local inference · qwen2.5:7b · Ollama · No data leaves the machine</div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
